#: src/main.rs:63
msgid ""
"Usage: ualias [OPTION]... [SERIAL [NAME]]\n"
"Look up or append a USB device alias in /etc/udev/ualias.d/*.\n"
"Without --name (or NAME), print the matching alias. With a name, append to ualias.d/local.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pemakaian: ualias [OPSI]... [SERIAL [NAMA]]\n"
"Cari atau tambah alias perangkat USB di /etc/udev/ualias.d/*.\n"
"Tanpa --name (atau NAMA), cetak alias yang cocok. Dengan nama, tambah ke ualias.d/local.\n"

